; Born, Not Made, Stage 3 (egg, DexArm): the folded Kresling baby, printed lying in the gel of the womb
; womb frame, millimeters: x toward the stern opening, y port, z up, origin at the egg center. A is the boom: x of the DexArm base (mm), the arm rides out of the tail on the boom
; volumetric extrusion: E in mm3 of mixed Dragon Skin 10 NV (bead area 1.86 mm2), 12G needle in a 6 mm push tube
; body plan: stage3_electronics/geom.py, 8 sides, 6 Kresling stories and one waist band; folded 184 mm, deployed 280 mm
; layer 1.5 mm, 59 layers; the electronics kit is placed once before layer 0, then the skin is printed around the kit
G21
G90
M83
M200 D0
M280 P1 S0 ; tool: needle down
; ---- place the electronics kit: one pick from the cradle on the port wall, one place on the seat (see kit.moves in stage3_egg.json)
M400
M280 P1 S90 ; tool: fork down
M0 ; the kit is placed at X-8.0 Y0.0 Z-220.8
